WEBVTT

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:05.080
Now, become one with me.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:09.550
Yeah, right... You're gonna 
become one with me.

00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:14.330
Once, there was a devil duelist, Z-ARC, 
who drove the world

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:17.350
to the brink of destruction.

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:24.290
Edo and Kaito were defeated as they 
worked to keep Z-ARC's parts,

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.000
Joeri and Hugo, from fusing.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.510
Even Hugo, his smile restored, thanks to Edo...

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:30.480
Battle!

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:36.200
Starving Venom Fusion Dragon attacks 
Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.760
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:52.930
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:56.330
Their dragons call to each other,

00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:59.530
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:33.230 --> 00:02:38.000
The Greatest Entertainer of the Age

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:42.710
Hugo!

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:45.720
Hugo...

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.450
What a great duel.

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.620
I don't think I've ever had one that was so fun.

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:59.150
Everyone I turned into cards before 
was all talk and little action.

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:01.590
You really are different, though.

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.760
You bet I am.

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.570
Who do you think I am?

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:08.830
Yes, you are me.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.170
And I am you.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:13.260
I felt it as we fought,

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:15.770
that it was fate that we met.

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:20.610
Had I known it would be this much fun, 
I would have fought you sooner.

00:03:20.610 --> 00:03:23.980
Sorry for treating you as an obstacle for so long.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:28.460
But we will be together forever now.

00:03:28.460 --> 00:03:31.880
We'll become one and never 
be separated again.

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:38.480
The cards...

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:39.730
They lit up...

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:41.460
No!

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:50.580
Now, we will...

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:53.560
...become one!

00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:17.760
We have finally become one.

00:04:17.760 --> 00:04:19.440
But we are still only halfway there.

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.400
I can tell.

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:26.380
The others with whom I must unite are close!

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:28.230
Now, we will...

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:31.240
...become one!

00:04:32.550 --> 00:04:33.940
Oh, no...

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:37.180
At this rate, he'll also absorb Joeri and Yuya,

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:39.790
and resurrect the complete Z-ARC!

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:48.670
Last, I attack D/D/D Stone King Darius!

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:56.340
Have I created a monster named "Layra"?

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.340
Brother...

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:10.960
I activated my Action Spell Miracle.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:16.520
So I negated destruction by battle 
and halved the damage taken.

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:20.600
Brother, you used an Action Card, too?

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:22.880
Why does that shock you?

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:25.800
This is how we Lancers fight.

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:31.160
To be honest, I underestimated you.

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:34.800
Since I taught you dueling from square one,

00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:38.410
I thought it would be impossible 
for you to surpass me.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:42.180
But it seems I must reevaluate 
that way of thinking.

00:05:43.180 --> 00:05:45.600
If you believe in Ray's resurrection

00:05:45.600 --> 00:05:48.890
and are determined to follow through 
on your words, that is fine.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.810
But I have decided to protect the 
peace of the four dimensions

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:56.820
and stop Leo Akaba's dimensional fusion plan.

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.830
If our paths must now lead us into conflict,

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:05.580
to continue down my own, I will use 
all that I have to defeat you.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:09.420
Now, there is nothing else you can do.

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:10.980
End your turn, Layra!

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:15.450
I... I end my turn.

00:06:15.860 --> 00:06:17.160
My turn!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:22.810
I set the Pendulum Scale with D/D Savant Thomas

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:28.430
and D/D/D Knowledge King Tomb Conquistador!

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:41.160
Now I can summon monsters between 
Level 2 and 5 simultaneously.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:43.750
Pendulum Summon!

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:47.460
Be reborn from my Extra Deck, D/D Brownie!

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:55.850
When D/D Brownie is Pendulum 
Summoned from my Extra Deck,

00:06:55.850 --> 00:07:02.330
I can tribute it and one D/D monster on 
my field to activate its monster effect.

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:08.300
I tribute D/D Brownie and 
D/D/D Stone King Darius,

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:19.060
to Special Summon D/D/D Tomb Conquistador 
from my Pendulum Zone!

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:29.850
Level 10...

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:35.500
But that monster has 3000 attack points, 
the same as Sonic Halberd.

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:38.610
You can't defeat me with a monster 
of equal attack points!

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:41.510
Tomb Conquistador's monster effect!

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:46.540
I send Dark Contract with the Eternal 
Darkness from my hand to my graveyard,

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:51.420
to increase Tomb Conquistador's attack points 
by 1000, until my End Phase!

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:53.380
4000 attack points?

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:54.690
Battle!

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:59.090
I attack Sonic Halberd with Tomb Conquistador!

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:01.560
The End of Empire!

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:08.980
Layra!

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:18.840
Mr. Sakaki!

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:29.690
Found you.

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:31.370
You...

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.040
Goodness me.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:38.600
I have a name, you know. 
It is Joeri. Call me that.

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:42.570
Although right now, I am Hugo, too.

00:08:42.860 --> 00:08:44.670
Y-You mean...

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:49.850
Yes, I'm afraid I couldn't stop it...

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:52.640
He stole Hugo before our eyes...

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:57.930
But you'll go no further!

00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:02.460
If I can defeat Joeri and prevent 
his fusion with Yuya,

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:04.670
Z-ARC's rebirth...

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:06.160
His rebirth will be prevented!

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:09.390
You never give up, do you, old man?

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:13.560
I thought I said I have no time to deal with you.

00:09:13.560 --> 00:09:14.700
Clear out!

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:19.300
Mr. Sakaki!

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:22.310
D-Dad...

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:25.740
Dad?

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:28.840
Don't take one step closer to Yuya!

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:32.320
You clear out, too!

00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:37.860
Brother...

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:39.910
Layra...

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:44.800
What did you mean by "Dad"?

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.440
Do you have a father?

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:47.830
Yes, he does.

00:09:49.220 --> 00:09:53.680
I'm Yuya's father. You can't have my son.

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:56.500
Oh? Father and son, eh?

00:09:57.090 --> 00:10:00.440
Is that why you are so persistent 
about stopping me?

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:06.750
But just because the father appears 
doesn't mean I will kindly back off.

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:10.110
After all, he also wants it.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:12.270
To become one with me...

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:13.220
Right?

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:15.240
I... I...

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:19.200
I will...

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:23.550
See? He can think of nothing but me.

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:25.580
No matter how you try to stop us.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:27.550
It isn't only for my son.

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:31.640
I have another reason I must fight you.

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:33.460
What is that?

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:38.350
The fact that you've gotten this far 
means you defeated Asuka...

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:42.590
And not only her. You turned many 
of my students into cards!

00:10:42.590 --> 00:10:44.750
Oh, is that it?

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:46.290
So what?

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:51.260
As their teacher, I must avenge them.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:54.680
They became cards because they were weak.

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:58.240
I don't know why you want to 
blame me for that...

00:10:58.560 --> 00:10:59.970
But oh, well...

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:03.020
Since you will keep trying to stop me,

00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:08.210
it might be fairly exciting to turn you 
into a card in front of your son.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:13.310
Fine... I will fight you,

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.780
caring father.

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:29.430
Joeri, having fused with Hugo, 
now closes in on Yuya Sakaki.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:32.000
We truly have no more time to lose.

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.400
Hurry to the next transmission!

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:40.310
But Ruri is supposed to wait until ARC-V's 
activation energy surpasses 70%...

00:11:40.310 --> 00:11:43.100
I don't care! Send her in now!

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:46.050
We need Ray to be reborn as soon as possible!

00:11:46.330 --> 00:11:47.130
Yes, sir.

00:11:53.490 --> 00:11:54.530
Dad...

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:58.140
Is Yuya fighting against Z-ARC?

00:11:58.140 --> 00:12:01.380
Z-ARC's rebirth is steadily approaching.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.000
That's what Ray is saying!

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:09.570
I'm grateful you'd accept my challenge.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:13.780
As long as we're dueling, let's try to enjoy it.

00:12:13.780 --> 00:12:15.930
I always enjoy everything.

00:12:15.930 --> 00:12:17.480
After all, I will not lose.

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:19.000
Won't you?

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.450
Until we fight, you don't know that.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.610
Oh, but I do.

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:25.080
I will win.

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:27.320
And I will turn you into a card, too.

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:29.520
Just as I did your students.

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:31.720
So which do you prefer?

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.530
Want to become a card at once,

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:36.430
or do you first want to have 
a bit of fun with me?

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.640
I'd much rather have the fun.

00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:42.340
In that case... I will have fun, in my own way.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:45.560
Duel!

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:50.450
I will go first.

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:55.820
I summon Predaplant Cephalotusnail 
from my hand!

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:03.000
Then I set two cards and end my turn.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:08.940
It was fun playing with Asuka, 
using the honor student deck,

00:13:08.940 --> 00:13:12.500
but this time, I think I will use 
my own to insta-kill you.

00:13:14.820 --> 00:13:17.590
I want to become one with 
him very soon, you see.

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:19.960
Are you done already?

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:25.390
Summoning one 1300-attack-point 
monster and setting two cards?

00:13:25.390 --> 00:13:28.160
I was hoping for more variety...

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:29.390
I'm disappointed.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:30.920
It will suffice.

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:33.090
I have prepared all I need to enjoy myself.

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:34.460
I see.

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:36.750
Then, I'll enjoy myself, too.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.320
Along with you.

00:13:38.320 --> 00:13:39.560
My turn!

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:45.040
When there are monsters on your 
side of the field but none on mine,

00:13:45.320 --> 00:13:49.240
I can Special Summon Performapal 
Revue Dancer from my hand!

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:58.720
Revue Dancer can count as two tributes.

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:04.900
I tribute Revue Dancer to Tribute 
Summon Performapal Sky Magician!

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:14.980
Is that...

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:18.300
Sky Magician...

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:21.000
Oh? A Magician, eh?

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.770
Then, your deck is Spellcaster themed?

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:25.740
Entertainment themed.

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:27.710
Entertainment?

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:33.580
Yes, my duels are about entertainment!

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:38.120
I'll invite you to the dazzling world 
of the entertainment duel!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:41.860
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.800
Dad...

00:14:43.800 --> 00:14:44.830
Mr. Sakaki...

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.830
Invite me to the world of entertainment?

00:14:46.830 --> 00:14:48.800
How will you go about that?

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:51.430
First, turn your eyes here.

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:55.770
From my hand, I activate Continuous 
Spell Magician's Right Hand!

00:14:59.280 --> 00:15:03.000
When there's a Spellcaster-Type 
Monster on my side of the field,

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:07.870
once per turn, I can negate the activation 
of one of your spell cards

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:09.720
and destroy it!

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:12.460
Destroy my spell card?

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:16.120
Yes, I believe one of them is your trump card.

00:15:16.120 --> 00:15:21.430
This turn, I'm going to guess what 
that card is and then purge it.

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:23.400
Guess his trump card?

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:26.880
This turn...

00:15:26.880 --> 00:15:32.610
In other words, you will identify which 
of my two set cards is my trump?

00:15:32.890 --> 00:15:35.580
Yes, without a doubt.

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:40.800
You said that Magician's Right Hand 
would destroy a spell card, right?

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:44.060
But isn't there a chance that both might be traps?

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:47.720
If that's the case, then I would lose this duel.

00:15:47.720 --> 00:15:49.760
Then I would gladly become a card.

00:15:50.600 --> 00:15:52.600
You are interesting, old man.

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:54.910
My duel with Hugo was pretty enjoyable,

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:56.970
but I think I might have fun with you, too.

00:15:57.230 --> 00:15:59.020
I'm honored to hear it.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:03.670
I hope you'll enjoy it, and that 
my duel will inspire you to smile.

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:06.540
Well, go ahead and guess.

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:08.150
Which is my trump card?

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:13.230
Before I do that, I will activate 
Sky Magician's effect.

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:16.120
When a Continuous Spell 
is activated on my field,

00:16:16.120 --> 00:16:18.940
its attack points increase by 300.

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:25.330
And now that Sky Magician 
has 2800 attack points,

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:29.380
I use it to attack Cephalotusnail!

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:35.340
I activate my Continuous Trap Dark Seed Planter!

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:39.770
All monsters on your field become Dark Attribute.

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:44.190
And when one of those monsters attacks a Dark 
Attribute Monster on my side of the field,

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:46.140
its effect is negated.

00:16:49.240 --> 00:16:51.670
Don't worry, Sky Magician won't...

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.620
Dad's ace monster...

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:57.930
It will not fall into darkness!

00:16:58.440 --> 00:16:59.400
Yuya...

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:04.280
In that instant, I activate Sky 
Magician's second effect!

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.800
When you activate a spell or trap,

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:11.900
I can return one Continuous Spell from 
my side of the field to my hand,

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:15.150
and activate a different Continuous 
Spell from my hand!

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:19.160
I return Magician's Right Hand to my hand,

00:17:19.160 --> 00:17:22.380
and activate Continuous Spell 
Magician's Left Hand!

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:27.390
Once per turn, its effect lets me negate

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:31.110
the activation of one of your 
trap cards and destroy it!

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:37.240
It went back to him!

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.400
Yeah.

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.540
Look.

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:47.340
Yusyo Sakaki's entertainment 
duel is reaching Yuya's heart.

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.260
Dad...

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.690
When I activate a Continuous Spell on my field,

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:59.510
Sky Magician's attack points increase by 300!

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:03.840
Now, I'll battle once more.

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:07.460
I attack Cephalotusnail with Sky Magician!

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:11.240
If this attack goes through...

00:18:11.240 --> 00:18:13.600
Joeri will take 1800 damage!

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:18.240
Cephalotusnail's monster effect!

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:22.580
It negates destruction in battle and 
halves the damage dealt to me!

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:33.360
Hey, just now, did you make a mistake?

00:18:37.300 --> 00:18:39.130
A mistake? Me?

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:45.960
You said you would destroy 
my trump card, right?

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:49.710
Isn't that why you activated 
Magician's Right Hand?

00:18:49.710 --> 00:18:51.800
But you panicked.

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:55.930
When I activated Dark Seed Planter,

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:58.450
you acted to protect your ace monster.

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:05.800
To destroy Dark Seed Planter with Magician's 
Left Hand, I withdrew Right Hand.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:07.420
It was all as I predicted!

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:12.090
My intention was to destroy 
your lone trump card.

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:16.780
Before I could do so, I had to get that 
other set card out of the way, right?

00:19:17.220 --> 00:19:21.940
To get me to activate my trap, 
you deliberately attacked?

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:27.180
Yes. And because you did just as I 
wished, my target's become clear.

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:33.420
I activate my spell card Clairvoyance 
from my hand!

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:35.470
Its effect...

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:39.890
If I correctly guess whether one of 
your set cards is a spell or a trap,

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:46.100
I return that card to your deck, 
as I draw two cards of my own!

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:47.520
What?

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:51.070
You act like you will be right, 
but your odds are still fifty-fifty.

00:19:51.070 --> 00:19:53.710
No, I know just what to say.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:55.270
I'll even name the card.

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:56.910
You haven't forgotten, have you?

00:19:57.510 --> 00:20:01.250
If you can't do it, you'll admit defeat.

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:03.210
Certainly.

00:20:03.610 --> 00:20:05.680
Then, go on and do it.

00:20:05.680 --> 00:20:06.820
Very well.

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:09.920
The fun is only getting started!

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:16.730
My answer to you...

00:20:17.410 --> 00:20:22.530
Before I reveal it, let me explain 
how I arrived at my conclusion.

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:26.500
You accepted my challenge for a duel,

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:29.930
but you also want to finish it quickly.

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:34.480
That was clear from your words 
at the end of the first turn.

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:36.330
It will suffice.

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.650
I have prepared all I need to enjoy myself.

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:39.930
From those words,

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:43.960
I knew that you planned to use 
that card during my turn.

00:20:43.960 --> 00:20:46.500
That was when I asked you a leading question.

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:50.540
Yes, I activated Magician's Right Hand

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:53.300
and provoked you by saying 
I'd destroy your trump card.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:21:00.040
But you didn't panic at all.

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:03.010
So was your trump card a trap?

00:21:03.640 --> 00:21:06.980
To find out, I challenged you to battle.

00:21:07.670 --> 00:21:11.020
I returned Magician's Right Hand to my hand

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:14.170
and activated Continuous Spell 
Magician's Left Hand,

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:18.920
to destroy the trap you activated.

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:22.390
I think you wanted to use Dark Seed Planter

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:25.400
to turn my Sky Magician to Dark Attribute,

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:28.630
then use it as a fusion component.

00:21:29.330 --> 00:21:33.120
In other words, your trump card 
is one that would ignore

00:21:33.120 --> 00:21:40.550
Magician's Right Hand's effect and use 
my monster as a fusion component.

00:21:41.790 --> 00:21:45.290
After all that, I think you know 
what I'm going to say.

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:48.620
Because I already know what it is!

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:52.400
Yes, your trump card is...

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:54.060
Super Polymerization!

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:03.370
Bull's-eye, right?

00:22:05.340 --> 00:22:06.570
Dad!

00:23:49.040 --> 00:23:52.510
This is so interesting! 
I am so glad I dueled you!

00:23:52.830 --> 00:23:56.580
No one has ever given me so much enjoyment!

00:23:56.580 --> 00:23:59.850
Not even Hugo...

00:23:59.850 --> 00:24:02.960
I will just have to thank you

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:04.660
in my own way.

00:24:05.220 --> 00:24:06.090
Are you okay?

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:07.920
Don't worry.

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:10.200
My dad will surely...

00:24:10.930 --> 00:24:15.200
Next time on Yu-Gi-OH! ARC-V: 
The Dazzling Entertainment Show.

00:24:15.200 --> 00:24:17.220
The fun is only getting started!
